 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-- **Input:** 3D scalar field data (e.g., DICOM volumes, VTI files) loaded via `vtkHttpDataSetReader` or similar IO modules.
-- **Output:** A rendered 2D image displayed in a fullscreen WebGL/WebGPU render window.
